                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1r">-1r</locus>عن القوم المجرمين , لقد كان في قصصهم عبرة الولي الالباب ما كان حديثا ان يفتري </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#241v">-241v</locus>ومنهم من اخذته الصيحة ومنهم من خسفنا به الارض</explicit>
                     <note>Consists of Qur’ān fragments bound together in mixed up order. Different hands. Part of the folios bound upside down. The edges have been trimmed and marginal notes are only partly visible. Text on fol. 1r begins with the last words of verse 12:110. Text on fol. 241v ends in the middle of verse 29:40. On fol. 194v, the heading of sūra 60. Words divided into two lines. Vocalized.</note>
